{"id":"1t-1-6","courseId":"1t","chapterNumber":"1.6","title":"Rationála cealkagat","description":"Oahpa oanidit, geardut, juohkit ja čoahkkáigeassit cuovkkaid algebralaš cealkagiiguin, ja čoavdit cuovkaovttamađodagaid.","estimatedMinutes":90,"competenceGoals":["álkidahttit algebralaš cuovkacealkagiid","čoavdit ovttamađodagaid main leat cuovkkat"],"content":[{"id":"1t-1-6-intro","type":"text","content":"## Cuovkkat algebralaš cealkagiiguin\n\n**Dárbbašlaš ovdamáhttu:** Algebra ja buvttadeapmi\n\nDán kapihttalis mii oahppat rehkenastit cuovkkaiguin main leat algebralaš cealkagat (bustávat). Mii geahčastit movt oanidit, geardut, juohkit ja čoahkkáigeassit dakkár cuovkkaid."},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-1","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 1","problem":"Oanit cuovkkaid:\n\na) $\\frac{2x}{3x}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x - 6}{6}$\n\nc) $\\frac{x^2 - 5x + 6}{x^2 - 4}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{2x}{3x} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{3 \\cdot x} = \\frac{2}{3}$\n\nb) $\\frac{3x - 6}{6} = \\frac{3 \\cdot (x - 2)}{3 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x - 2}{2}$\n\nc) $\\frac{x^2 - 5x + 6}{x^2 - 4} = \\frac{(x - 2)(x - 3)}{(x - 2)(x + 2)} = \\frac{x - 3}{x + 2}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Oanit cuovkkaid","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{4x}{9x}$","solution":"$\\frac{4x}{9x} = \\frac{4 \\cdot x}{9 \\cdot x} = \\frac{4}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"4/9"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{x^2 - 2x}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{x^2 - 2x} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{x \\cdot (x - 2)} = \\frac{2}{x - 2}$","expressionAnswer":"2/(x-2)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 5x}{x - 5}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^2 - 5x}{x - 5} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x - 5)}{x - 5} = x$","expressionAnswer":"x"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x - 8}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x - 8}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x - 4)}{2 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x - 4}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-4)/2"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x + 3} = \\frac{(x - 3) \\cdot (x + 3)}{x + 3} = x - 3$","expressionAnswer":"x-3"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 7x + 12}{2x - 6}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^2 - 7x + 12}{2x - 6} = \\frac{(x - 3) \\cdot (x - 4)}{2 \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{x - 4}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-4)/2"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{4}{9}$, b) $\\frac{2}{x-2}$, c) $x$, d) $\\frac{x-4}{2}$, e) $x-3$, f) $\\frac{x-4}{2}$","hints":["Buvttat čájeheaddji ja namuheaddji ovdal go oaniduvvot"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-2","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 2","problem":"Gerdo ja oanit cuovkkaid:\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3x} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{4}$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{2x + 8} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{3x}$\n\nc) $3x^2 \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3x^2 - 27}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{2}{3x} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3x \\cdot 4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3x \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{x + 3}{6x}$\n\nb) $\\frac{x}{2x + 8} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{3x} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x + 4)}{(2x + 8) \\cdot 3x} = \\frac{x \\cdot (x + 4) \\cdot 1}{2(x + 4) \\cdot 3 \\cdot x} = \\frac{1}{6}$\n\nc) $3x^2 \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3x^2 - 27} = \\frac{3x^2}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x + 3}{3(x^2 - 9)} = \\frac{3 \\cdot x^2 \\cdot (x + 3)}{3 \\cdot (x + 3) \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{x^2}{x - 3}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Gerdo ja oanit (jos vejolaš) cuovkkaid","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x + 5}{5x} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2x + 10}$","solution":"$\\frac{x + 5}{5x} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2x + 10} = \\frac{(x + 5) \\cdot 5}{5x \\cdot 2(x + 5)} = \\frac{5 \\cdot (x + 5)}{5 \\cdot 2 \\cdot x \\cdot (x + 5)} = \\frac{1}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(2x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3x - 12} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{3x - 12} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{4} = \\frac{2x}{3(x-4)} \\cdot \\frac{(x-4)(x+4)}{4} = \\frac{2 \\cdot x \\cdot (x-4) \\cdot (x+4)}{3 \\cdot (x-4) \\cdot 4} = \\frac{x(x+4)}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"x*(x+4)/6"},{"label":"c","task":"$5x \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x^2 - 16x}$","solution":"$5x \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x^2 - 16x} = \\frac{5x}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x + 4}{4x(x - 4)} = \\frac{5 \\cdot x \\cdot (x + 4)}{4 \\cdot x \\cdot (x - 4)} = \\frac{5(x + 4)}{4(x - 4)}$","expressionAnswer":"5*(x+4)/(4*(x-4))"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{1}{2x}$, b) $\\frac{x(x+4)}{6}$, c) $\\frac{5(x+4)}{4(x-4)}$","hints":["Buvtta vuos, dasto oaniduvvot ovttalágán fáktoriid čájeheaddjis ja namuheaddjis"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Gerdo ja oanit (jos vejolaš) cuovkkaid","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\div \\frac{2x}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\div \\frac{2x}{3} = \\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2x} = \\frac{x \\cdot 3}{2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot x} = \\frac{3}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"3/4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\div \\frac{x^2 - 81}{2x + 8}$","solution":"$\\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\div \\frac{x^2 - 81}{2x + 8} = \\frac{x + 9}{2x} \\cdot \\frac{2x + 8}{(x-9)(x+9)} = \\frac{(x + 9) \\cdot 2(x + 4)}{2x \\cdot (x-9) \\cdot (x+9)} = \\frac{x + 4}{x(x - 9)}$","expressionAnswer":"(x+4)/(x*(x-9))"},{"label":"c","task":"$4x \\div \\frac{x}{x^2 - 16}$","solution":"$4x \\div \\frac{x}{x^2 - 16} = \\frac{4x}{1} \\cdot \\frac{x^2 - 16}{x} = \\frac{4 \\cdot x \\cdot (x-4)(x+4)}{x} = 4(x-4)(x+4)$","expressionAnswer":"4*(x-4)*(x+4)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{4}$, b) $\\frac{x+4}{x(x-9)}$, c) $4(x-4)(x+4)$","hints":["Juohkimis: jorgal nuppi cuovkka ja gerdo"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-3","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 3","problem":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid:\n\n$\\frac{9x + 3y}{4x} - \\frac{x - 3y}{4x}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$\\frac{9x + 3y}{4x} - \\frac{x - 3y}{4x} = \\frac{9x + 3y - (x - 3y)}{4x} = \\frac{9x + 3y - x + 3y}{4x}$\n\n$= \\frac{8x + 6y}{4x} = \\frac{2(4x + 3y)}{2 \\cdot 2x} = \\frac{4x + 3y}{2x}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2x}{4} + \\frac{3x}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{4} + \\frac{3x}{4} = \\frac{2x + 3x}{4} = \\frac{5x}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"5x/4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{8x}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{8x}{3} = \\frac{2x - 8x}{3} = \\frac{-6x}{3} = -2x$","expressionAnswer":"-2x"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{y}{5} - \\frac{3y}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{y}{5} - \\frac{3y}{5} = \\frac{y - 3y}{5} = \\frac{-2y}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"-2y/5"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x - y}{4x} - \\frac{3x}{4x}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x - y}{4x} - \\frac{3x}{4x} = \\frac{(2x - y) - 3x}{4x} = \\frac{2x - y - 3x}{4x} = \\frac{-x - y}{4x}$","expressionAnswer":"(-x-y)/(4x)"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{3 - 6x}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{2x}{3} - \\frac{3 - 6x}{3} = \\frac{x + 2x - (3 - 6x)}{3} = \\frac{x + 2x - 3 + 6x}{3} = \\frac{9x - 3}{3} = \\frac{3(3x - 1)}{3} = 3x - 1$","expressionAnswer":"3x-1"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{x + 6}{2x + 1} - \\frac{3x - 4}{2x + 1}$","solution":"$\\frac{x + 6}{2x + 1} - \\frac{3x - 4}{2x + 1} = \\frac{(x + 6) - (3x - 4)}{2x + 1} = \\frac{x + 6 - 3x + 4}{2x + 1} = \\frac{-2x + 10}{2x + 1}$","expressionAnswer":"(-2x+10)/(2x+1)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{5x}{4}$, b) $-2x$, c) $\\frac{-2y}{5}$, d) $\\frac{-x-y}{4x}$, e) $3x-1$, f) $\\frac{-2x+10}{2x+1}$","hints":["Go namuheaddjit leat ovttaláganat, de čoahkkáigeasat čájeheaddjiid"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-theorem-utviding","type":"theorem","title":"Cuovkkaid viiddideapmi","content":"Vai sáhttit čoahkkáigeassit cuovkkaid main leat **iešguđetlágán namuheaddjit**, fertet vuos viiddidit cuovkkaid nu ahte ožžot **ovttalágán namuheaddji** (oktasaš namuheaddji).\n\nMii viiddidit cuovkka go geardut čájeheaddji ja namuheaddji seamma fáktoriin."},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-4","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 4","problem":"Viiddit cuovkka nu ahte oaččut $x^2 - 4$ namuheaddjin:\n\n$\\frac{3}{x - 2}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$\\frac{3}{x - 2} = \\frac{3(x + 2)}{(x - 2)(x + 2)} = \\frac{3x + 6}{x^2 - 4}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Viiddit cuovkka","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{9}{x - 2}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá $2x - 4$","solution":"Mii oaidnit ahte $2x - 4 = 2(x - 2)$, nu ahte mii fertet geardut $2$:in: $\\frac{9}{x - 2} = \\frac{9 \\cdot 2}{(x - 2) \\cdot 2} = \\frac{18}{2x - 4}$","expressionAnswer":"18/(2x-4)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{x + 3}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá $x^2 - 9$","solution":"Mii oaidnit ahte $x^2 - 9 = (x + 3)(x - 3)$, nu ahte mii fertet geardut $(x - 3)$:in: $\\frac{5}{x + 3} = \\frac{5 \\cdot (x - 3)}{(x + 3) \\cdot (x - 3)} = \\frac{5x - 15}{x^2 - 9}$","expressionAnswer":"(5x-15)/(x^2-9)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3x}{x - 2}$ nu ahte namuheaddji šaddá $2x^2 - 8$","solution":"Mii oaidnit ahte $2x^2 - 8 = 2(x^2 - 4) = 2(x - 2)(x + 2)$, nu ahte mii fertet geardut $2(x + 2)$:in: $\\frac{3x}{x - 2} = \\frac{3x \\cdot 2(x + 2)}{(x - 2) \\cdot 2(x + 2)} = \\frac{6x(x + 2)}{2x^2 - 8}$","expressionAnswer":"6x*(x+2)/(2x^2-8)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{18}{2x-4}$, b) $\\frac{5x-15}{x^2-9}$, c) $\\frac{6x(x+2)}{2x^2-8}$","hints":["Gávnna maid fertet geardut namuheaddjiin vai oaččut sávvojuvvon namuheaddji, ja gerdo čájeheaddji seammáin"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-5","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 5","problem":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid:\n\n$\\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$\\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3 \\cdot y}{2 \\cdot y} = \\frac{5x}{2y} + \\frac{3y}{2y} = \\frac{5x + 3y}{2y}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{2} + \\frac{1}{2x}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $2x$: $\\frac{3}{2} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3 \\cdot x}{2 \\cdot x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3x}{2x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3x + 1}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"(3x+1)/(2x)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4x}{2} + \\frac{2x}{5}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $10$: $\\frac{4x}{2} + \\frac{2x}{5} = \\frac{4x \\cdot 5}{2 \\cdot 5} + \\frac{2x \\cdot 2}{5 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{20x}{10} + \\frac{4x}{10} = \\frac{24x}{10} = \\frac{12x}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"12x/5"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2y}{5} - \\frac{x}{3}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $15$: $\\frac{2y}{5} - \\frac{x}{3} = \\frac{2y \\cdot 3}{5 \\cdot 3} - \\frac{x \\cdot 5}{3 \\cdot 5} = \\frac{6y}{15} - \\frac{5x}{15} = \\frac{6y - 5x}{15}$","expressionAnswer":"(6y-5x)/15"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3x}{2y} + \\frac{2y}{x}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $2xy$: $\\frac{3x}{2y} + \\frac{2y}{x} = \\frac{3x \\cdot x}{2y \\cdot x} + \\frac{2y \\cdot 2y}{x \\cdot 2y} = \\frac{3x^2}{2xy} + \\frac{4y^2}{2xy} = \\frac{3x^2 + 4y^2}{2xy}$","expressionAnswer":"(3x^2+4y^2)/(2xy)"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x}{5} - 3x$","solution":"Čállit $3x$ cuovkan namuheaddjiin $5$: $\\frac{x}{5} - 3x = \\frac{x}{5} - \\frac{3x \\cdot 5}{5} = \\frac{x}{5} - \\frac{15x}{5} = \\frac{x - 15x}{5} = \\frac{-14x}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"-14x/5"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4x}{11} - 2$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $11y$: $\\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4x \\cdot y}{11 \\cdot y} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 11y}{11y} = \\frac{2x}{11y} - \\frac{4xy}{11y} - \\frac{22y}{11y} = \\frac{2x - 4xy - 22y}{11y}$","expressionAnswer":"(2x-4xy-22y)/(11y)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3x+1}{2x}$, b) $\\frac{12x}{5}$, c) $\\frac{6y-5x}{15}$, d) $\\frac{3x^2+4y^2}{2xy}$, e) $\\frac{-14x}{5}$, f) $\\frac{2x-4xy-22y}{11y}$","hints":["Gávnna oktasaš namuheaddji ja viiddit juohke cuovkka"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-6","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 6","problem":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid:\n\n$\\frac{4}{3xy} + \\frac{3x}{2y} - 2$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$\\frac{4}{3xy} + \\frac{3x}{2y} - \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{4 \\cdot 2}{3xy \\cdot 2} + \\frac{3x \\cdot 3x}{2y \\cdot 3x} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 6xy}{1 \\cdot 6xy} = \\frac{8}{6xy} + \\frac{9x^2}{6xy} - \\frac{12xy}{6xy}$\n\n$= \\frac{8 + 9x^2 - 12xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9x^2 - 12xy + 8}{6xy}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{3}{2xy} + \\frac{1}{3x} - 1$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $6xy$: $\\frac{3}{2xy} + \\frac{1}{3x} - 1 = \\frac{3 \\cdot 3}{2xy \\cdot 3} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 2y}{3x \\cdot 2y} - \\frac{1 \\cdot 6xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9}{6xy} + \\frac{2y}{6xy} - \\frac{6xy}{6xy} = \\frac{9 + 2y - 6xy}{6xy}$","expressionAnswer":"(9+2y-6xy)/(6xy)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{2ab} + \\frac{1}{5}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $10ab$: $\\frac{3}{2ab} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 5}{2ab \\cdot 5} + \\frac{1 \\cdot 2ab}{5 \\cdot 2ab} = \\frac{15}{10ab} + \\frac{2ab}{10ab} = \\frac{15 + 2ab}{10ab}$","expressionAnswer":"(15+2ab)/(10ab)"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{5x} - \\frac{1}{3y} - 1$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $15xy$: $\\frac{2}{5x} - \\frac{1}{3y} - 1 = \\frac{2 \\cdot 3y}{5x \\cdot 3y} - \\frac{1 \\cdot 5x}{3y \\cdot 5x} - \\frac{15xy}{15xy} = \\frac{6y}{15xy} - \\frac{5x}{15xy} - \\frac{15xy}{15xy} = \\frac{6y - 5x - 15xy}{15xy}$","expressionAnswer":"(6y-5x-15xy)/(15xy)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{9+2y-6xy}{6xy}$, b) $\\frac{15+2ab}{10ab}$, c) $\\frac{6y-5x-15xy}{15xy}$","hints":["Gávnna oktasaš namuheaddji buot lađđasiidda"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-7","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 7","problem":"Čoahkkáigeasa:\n\n$\\frac{4}{x + 2} - 2$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$\\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2}{1} = \\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2(x + 2)}{1(x + 2)} = \\frac{4}{x + 2} - \\frac{2x + 4}{x + 2} = \\frac{4 - (2x + 4)}{x + 2}$\n\n$= \\frac{4 - 2x - 4}{x + 2} = \\frac{-2x}{x + 2}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{5}{x + 2} + \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $3(x + 2)$: $\\frac{5}{x + 2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5 \\cdot 3}{(x + 2) \\cdot 3} + \\frac{1 \\cdot (x + 2)}{3 \\cdot (x + 2)} = \\frac{15}{3(x + 2)} + \\frac{x + 2}{3(x + 2)} = \\frac{15 + x + 2}{3(x + 2)} = \\frac{x + 17}{3(x + 2)}$","expressionAnswer":"(x+17)/(3*(x+2))"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $2(x + 3)$: $\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2}{(x + 3) \\cdot 2} - \\frac{1 \\cdot (x + 3)}{2 \\cdot (x + 3)} = \\frac{4}{2(x + 3)} - \\frac{x + 3}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{4 - (x + 3)}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{1 - x}{2(x + 3)}$","expressionAnswer":"(1-x)/(2*(x+3))"},{"label":"c","task":"$2 - \\frac{x + 2}{3}$","solution":"Čállit $2$ cuovkan: $2 - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 3}{3} - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{6}{3} - \\frac{x + 2}{3} = \\frac{6 - (x + 2)}{3} = \\frac{6 - x - 2}{3} = \\frac{4 - x}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"(4-x)/3"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{y + 1} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $2(y + 1)$: $\\frac{3}{y + 1} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 2}{(y + 1) \\cdot 2} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{6}{2(y + 1)} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{10}{2(y + 1)} = \\frac{5}{y + 1}$","expressionAnswer":"5/(y+1)"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x}{5x} - 2$","solution":"Oanit vuos: $\\frac{x}{5x} - 2 = \\frac{1}{5} - 2 = \\frac{1}{5} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{5} = \\frac{1}{5} - \\frac{10}{5} = \\frac{1 - 10}{5} = \\frac{-9}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"-9/5"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - 2$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $3x$: $\\frac{2}{3} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - 2 = \\frac{2 \\cdot x}{3 \\cdot x} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 3x}{3x} = \\frac{2x}{3x} - \\frac{x - 3}{3x} - \\frac{6x}{3x} = \\frac{2x - (x - 3) - 6x}{3x} = \\frac{2x - x + 3 - 6x}{3x} = \\frac{-5x + 3}{3x}$","expressionAnswer":"(-5x+3)/(3x)"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{x+17}{3(x+2)}$, b) $\\frac{1-x}{2(x+3)}$, c) $\\frac{4-x}{3}$, d) $\\frac{5}{y+1}$, e) $\\frac{-9}{5}$, f) $\\frac{-5x+3}{3x}$","hints":["Muitte bidjat ruođuid go gesat eret cuovkka"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-8","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 8","problem":"Čoahkkáigeasa:\n\n$\\frac{5}{x - 3} - \\frac{3}{2}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$\\frac{5}{x - 3} - \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 5}{2(x - 3)} - \\frac{3(x - 3)}{2(x - 3)} = \\frac{10}{2x - 6} - \\frac{3x - 9}{2x - 6}$\n\n$= \\frac{10 - (3x - 9)}{2x - 6} = \\frac{10 - 3x + 9}{2x - 6} = \\frac{-3x + 19}{2x - 6}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-9","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 9","problem":"Čoahkkáigeasa:\n\n$\\frac{2}{x - 4} - \\frac{1}{x + 4}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\nMii oaidnit ahte oktasaš namuheaddji lea $(x - 4)(x + 4)$\n\n$\\frac{2}{x - 4} - \\frac{1}{x + 4} = \\frac{2(x + 4)}{(x - 4)(x + 4)} - \\frac{1(x - 4)}{(x + 4)(x - 4)}$\n\n$= \\frac{2x + 8 - 1(x - 4)}{(x - 4)(x + 4)} = \\frac{2x + 8 - x + 4}{(x - 4)(x + 4)} = \\frac{x + 12}{x^2 - 16}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-block-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Čoahkkáigeasa cuovkkaid ja oanit jos vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 2} + \\frac{3}{x - 2}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $(x+2)(x-2)$: $\\frac{2}{x + 2} + \\frac{3}{x - 2} = \\frac{2 \\cdot (x-2)}{(x+2)(x-2)} + \\frac{3 \\cdot (x+2)}{(x-2)(x+2)} = \\frac{2x - 4 + 3x + 6}{(x+2)(x-2)} = \\frac{5x + 2}{x^2 - 4}$","expressionAnswer":"(5x+2)/(x^2-4)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2x + 6}$","solution":"Buvttat: $2x + 6 = 2(x+3)$. Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $2(x+3)$: $\\frac{2}{x + 3} - \\frac{1}{2(x + 3)} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 2}{(x+3) \\cdot 2} - \\frac{1}{2(x+3)} = \\frac{4}{2(x+3)} - \\frac{1}{2(x+3)} = \\frac{3}{2(x+3)}$","expressionAnswer":"3/(2*(x+3))"},{"label":"c","task":"$3 - \\frac{x + 2}{x^2 + 2x}$","solution":"Buvttat: $x^2 + 2x = x(x + 2)$. De sáhttit oanidit: $3 - \\frac{x + 2}{x(x + 2)} = 3 - \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{3x}{x} - \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{3x - 1}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"(3x-1)/x"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{y + 4} + \\frac{4}{2y + 8} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"Buvttat: $2y + 8 = 2(y + 4)$. $\\frac{3}{y + 4} + \\frac{4}{2(y + 4)} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{6}{2(y+4)} + \\frac{4}{2(y+4)} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{10}{2(y+4)} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{5}{y+4} - \\frac{1}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"(15-y-4)/(3*(y+4))"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{1}{3x} - \\frac{2}{x + 1}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $3x(x+1)$: $\\frac{1}{3x} - \\frac{2}{x + 1} = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1)}{3x \\cdot (x+1)} - \\frac{2 \\cdot 3x}{(x+1) \\cdot 3x} = \\frac{x + 1}{3x(x+1)} - \\frac{6x}{3x(x+1)} = \\frac{x + 1 - 6x}{3x(x+1)} = \\frac{1 - 5x}{3x(x+1)}$","expressionAnswer":"(1-5x)/(3x*(x+1))"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{x - 3}{x - 2} - \\frac{2}{x - 1}$","solution":"Oktasaš namuheaddji lea $2(x-2)(x-1)$. Dát lea váttis bargu - geahča ollislaš čoavddusa čoavddusovdamearkkas."}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{5x+2}{x^2-4}$, b) $\\frac{3}{2(x+3)}$, c) $\\frac{3x-1}{x}$, d) $\\frac{5}{y+4} - \\frac{1}{3}$, e) $\\frac{1-5x}{3x(x+1)}$, f) Geahča čoavddusa","hints":["Buvttat namuheaddjiid vai gávnnat oktasaš namuheaddji"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-example-10","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 10","problem":"Čoahkkáigeasa:\n\n$\\frac{2}{x + 2} - \\frac{4}{3x - 3}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\n$\\frac{2}{x + 2} + \\frac{4}{3x - 3} = \\frac{2}{(x + 2)} - \\frac{4}{3(x - 1)}$\n\n$= \\frac{3 \\cdot 2(x - 1)}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} - \\frac{4(x + 2)}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} = \\frac{6(x - 1) - 4(x + 2)}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)}$\n\n$= \\frac{6x - 6 - 4x - 8}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} = \\frac{2x - 14}{3(x - 1)(x + 2)} = \\frac{2x - 14}{3x^2 + 3x - 6}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Čoahkkáigeassu\n\n- **Rationála cealkagiid oanideapmi:** Buvttat sihke čájeheaddji ja namuheaddji, dasto sihko ovttalágán fáktoriid\n- **Geardun:** $\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ac}{bd}$ - gerdo čájeheddjiid ja gerdo namuheddjiid, oanit dađistaga jos vejolaš\n- **Juohkin:** $\\frac{a}{b} \\div \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{d}{c}$ - jorgal nuppi cuovkka ja gerdo\n- **Lasiheapmi/eretváldin ovttalágán namuheddjiin:** Čoahkkáigeasa čájeheddjiid, doalat namuheaddji\n- **Viiddideapmi:** Gerdo sihke čájeheaddji ja namuheaddji seamma fáktoriin vai oaččut sávvojuvvon namuheaddji\n- **Oktasaš namuheaddji:** Buvttat namuheaddjiid ja gávnna uhcimus oktasaš buvtta, dahje gerdo namuheaddjiid guhtet guimmiiguin\n- Leage várrugas ovddabealmearkkaiguin go gesat eret cuovkkaid: $\\frac{a}{b} - \\frac{c}{d} = \\frac{ad - bc}{bd}$"},{"id":"1t-1-6-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Geardduhanbihtát","buttonText":"Čájet geardduhanbihtáid","content":[{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Oanit cuovkkaid","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{6x}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"2x"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{4x^2}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"2x"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{10xy}{5y}$","expressionAnswer":"2x"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3x + 6}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"x+2"}],"solution":"a) $2x$, b) $2x$, c) $2x$, d) $\\frac{3(x+2)}{3} = x + 2$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Buvttat čájeheaddji ja namuheaddji, ja sihko oktasaš fáktoriid."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rehkenaste ja oanit","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{4}{x}$","answer":2},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{3}{x} \\cdot \\frac{x^2}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"x/2"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{a}{b} \\cdot \\frac{b}{a}$","answer":1},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x}{3} \\cdot \\frac{9}{4x}$","expressionAnswer":"3/2"}],"solution":"a) $2$, b) $\\frac{x}{2}$, c) $1$, d) $\\frac{3}{2}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gerdo čájeheaddji čájeheaddjiin ja namuheaddji namuheaddjiin, ja oanit dađistaga."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Buvttat ja oanit","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - 9}{x - 3}$","expressionAnswer":"x+3"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{x^2 + 5x}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"x+5"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2x + 4}{x + 2}$","answer":2},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{x^2 - x}{x^2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x-1)/x"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{(x+3)(x-3)}{x-3} = x + 3$, b) $\\frac{x(x+5)}{x} = x + 5$, c) $\\frac{2(x+2)}{x+2} = 2$, d) $\\frac{x(x-1)}{x^2} = \\frac{x-1}{x}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Buvttat vuos čájeheaddji. a):s sáhtát geavahit konjugáhtacealkaga (no: konjugatsetningen)."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Gávnna oktasaš namuheaddji ja rehkenaste","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{x}{3} + \\frac{x}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"x/2"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{3}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"5/x"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{2x}$","expressionAnswer":"3/(2x)"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{x + 1}{2} + \\frac{x - 1}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"x"}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{2x}{6} + \\frac{x}{6} = \\frac{3x}{6} = \\frac{x}{2}$, b) $\\frac{5}{x}$, c) $\\frac{2}{2x} + \\frac{1}{2x} = \\frac{3}{2x}$, d) $\\frac{2x}{2} = x$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Viiddit cuovkkaid nu ahte ožžot seamma namuheaddji ovdal go laskkat daid oktii."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-6-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Rehkenaste ja čále nu álkit go vejolaš","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{x + 1} + \\frac{3}{x - 1}$","expressionAnswer":"(5x+1)/(x^2-1)"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{x}{x - 2} - \\frac{2}{x - 2}$","answer":1},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{1}{x + 1}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(x*(x+1))"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{\\;\\frac{x}{2}\\;}{\\;\\frac{x}{4}\\;}$","answer":2}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{2(x-1) + 3(x+1)}{(x+1)(x-1)} = \\frac{5x + 1}{x^2 - 1}$, b) $\\frac{x - 2}{x - 2} = 1$, c) $\\frac{(x+1) - x}{x(x+1)} = \\frac{1}{x(x+1)}$, d) $\\frac{x}{2} \\cdot \\frac{4}{x} = 2$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["a):s lea oktasaš namuheaddji $(x+1)(x-1)$. d):s gerdot jorggu cuovkkain."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}],"exercises":[],"_meta":{"malform":"sme","status":"draft-needs-human-review","translatedBy":"claude-code-pilot","note":"PILOT: nordsamisk utkast. Terminologi forankret i mattesatnelistu. Setningsgrammatikk, kasus og konstruerte sammensetninger MÅ verifiseres av nordsamisktalende revisor før publisering."}}
